"""
FULL UNIFIED SCRIPT (latest changes integrated)

Binance Spot (hourly) + Margin-universe filter + ElasticNet regression signal -> trades
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Key features implemented:

1) Universe limited to assets available on Binance CROSS MARGIN market:
   - Uses GET https://api.binance.com/sapi/v1/margin/allPairs
   - Filters to USDT-quoted margin pairs only.

2) Execution realism:
   - Entry is ALWAYS the next-hour open (first hour of next day). NO VWAP, NO “VWAP or better”.
   - Signal computed at end-of-day (last hour).

3) Label definition:
   - Regression target y = future return over cfg["label_horizon_hours"] from next-day entry close.

4) Training set focus:
   - Train ONLY on extreme movers each day:
       top/bottom cfg["train_extreme_pct"] of returns,
       with min cfg["train_extreme_min"] and max cfg["train_extreme_max"] per side.

5) Binary Interaction Toggle strategy:
   - Regime gates computed from coarse market features:
       G_VOL   = 1 if mkt_rv > rolling median(mkt_rv)
       G_TREND = 1 if abs(mkt_ret24h) > threshold
   - Interaction expansion for causal features:
       feature_G_VOL_0, feature_G_VOL_1
       feature_G_TREND_0, feature_G_TREND_1
   - Optionally drops raw causal features to force regime-specific paths.

6) Candidate gating & sizing:
   - Long candidates: pred >= thr_long
   - Short candidates: pred <= thr_short
   - Sizing capped: gross exposure <= 25% wallet (cfg["wallet_gross_cap"])
   - Allocation proportional to score(pred) (tanh or relu mapping).

7) Trade lifecycle:
   - Enter positions (next-hour open)
   - Monitor TP/SL on hourly bars; exit on TP/SL or hold timeout.

8) Automatic Stability / Coefficient Persistence integrated into gating:
   - Tracks coefficient persistence over rolling windows.
   - Uses persistence in TWO ways:
     (A) Feature gating: unstable interaction features are zeroed out in X before prediction.
     (B) Exposure scaling: daily gross wallet cap is scaled by stability_score in [0,1].
         (Optional) No-trade if stability_score < cfg["min_model_stability_to_trade"].

Dependencies:
  pip install ccxt pandas numpy requests scikit-learn
"""

import time
import math
